const interact10=$('interact').onclick;$('interact').onclick=()=>{if(arrived?.id==='freezer')return openInventory('freezer');if(arrived?.id==='woods')return openWoods();if(arrived?.id==='pots')return openPots();interact10();};
function freshPots(){return [null,null];}
function potOutcome(){if(Math.random()<.17)return null;const id=['crab','crab','prawn','hermit'][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];return {species:id,size:Math.round((id==='prawn'?4+Math.random()*8:id==='hermit'?2+Math.random()*5:5+Math.random()*12)*10)/10,caughtAt:new Date().toISOString(),tone:Math.floor(Math.random()*4)};}
function baitPot(index,key){routine.pots||=freshPots();if(!Number.isInteger(index)||index<0||index>1||routine.pots[index]||!foodTypes[key]||key==='water'||!(economy.stock[key]>0))return false;economy.stock[key]--;routine.pots[index]={readyAt:absoluteMinute()+180,catch:potOutcome()};persist();playFX('drop');return true;}
function collectPot(index,keep=true){routine.pots||=freshPots();const p=routine.pots[index];if(!p||absoluteMinute()<p.readyAt)return false;routine.pots[index]=null;if(p.catch){routine.poolRecords[p.catch.species]=(routine.poolRecords[p.catch.species]||0)+1;if(keep)routine.creatures.push(p.catch);}persist();updatePoolCount();updateChecklist(true);return true;}
function openPots(message=''){routine.pots||=freshPots();modal('Your crab pots',`${message?`<p class="trade-message">${message}</p>`:''}<div class="pots-scene">${routine.pots.map((p,i)=>{const done=p&&absoluteMinute()>=p.readyAt;return `<div class="pot-card ${done?'pot-ready':''}">${objectIcon11('crabpot')}<b>Pot ${i+1}</b><span>${!p?'Empty':done?'Ready to lift':quarterClock(p.readyAt)+' · soaking'}</span><button id="pot-${i}" class="action ${done?'gold':''}" ${p&&!done?'disabled':''}>${!p?'Add food':done?'Lift pot':'Soaking'}</button></div>`;}).join('')}</div><button id="potBucket" class="action">${artIcon('bucket')} ${routine.creatures.length}</button>`,'BY THE SHALLOWS');for(let i=0;i<2;i++)$('pot-'+i).onclick=()=>{const p=routine.pots[i];if(!p){const foods=Object.keys(foodTypes).filter(k=>k!=='water'&&(economy.stock[k]||0)>0);modal('A little bait',foods.map(k=>`<button id="potbait-${k}" class="action">${foodIcon(k)} ${foodTypes[k].name} ×${economy.stock[k]}</button>`).join('')+(foods.length?'':'<p>Bring a little food from your fridge.</p>')+'<button id="potBack" class="action">Back</button>','ONE PORTION');for(const k of foods)$('potbait-'+k).onclick=()=>{baitPot(i,k);openPots('Set in the shallows. Come back after '+quarterClock(routine.pots[i].readyAt)+'.');};$('potBack').onclick=()=>openPots();}else if(absoluteMinute()>=p.readyAt){if(!p.catch){collectPot(i);openPots('Only seaweed this time. A fresh piece of bait might help.');return;}const c=p.catch;modal('Look who came visiting',`<div class="pot-catch">${creatureIcon(c.species)}</div><p class="catch-name">${htmlText(poolSpecies.find(s=>s.id===c.species).name)}</p><p>${c.size.toFixed(1)} cm</p><button id="keepPotCatch" class="action gold">Into the bucket</button><button id="releasePotCatch" class="action">Put back</button>`,'A LITTLE DISCOVERY');$('keepPotCatch').onclick=()=>{collectPot(i,true);openPots();};$('releasePotCatch').onclick=()=>{collectPot(i,false);openPots('Back in the shallows.');};}};$('potBucket').onclick=()=>openBag();}
function openWoods(){modal('A quiet place among the trees',`<div class="shrine-scene">${objectIcon11('shrine')}</div><div class="shrine-sockets" aria-label="Five empty places">${['○','△','□','☾','◇'].map((symbol,i)=>`<button id="shrine-${i}" aria-label="Inspect empty ${['round','triangular','square','crescent','diamond'][i]} recess">${symbol}</button>`).join('')}</div><p id="shrineThought" class="shrine-thought">Five empty places. Each marked with a different symbol.</p><button id="woodsWood" class="action">${objectIcon11('logs')} Gather wood</button>`,'THE WOODLAND SHRINE');routine.shrineSeen=true;persist();const lines=['A wave worn into the stone. Something once rested here.','Fine lines branch out like pine needles.','The outline looks a little like a distant tower.','A pale crescent, smooth beneath your fingers.','A pattern like reeds reflected in still water.'];for(let i=0;i<5;i++)$('shrine-'+i).onclick=()=>{$('shrineThought').textContent=lines[i];};$('woodsWood').onclick=openWoodcutting;}
